<title>USA: Textron acquires turf care business.</title>
<headline>Textron acquires turf care business.</headline>
<dateline>PROVIDENCE, R.I. 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Textron Inc said on Friday it has acquired The Bunton Co, a maker of rotary lawn-care equipment for commercial markets such as professional landscapers.</p>
<p>Bunton will become part of Jacobsen Textron, a maker of turf-care equipment for the golf and commercial markets, Textron said.</p>
<p>Terms of the sale were not disclosed.</p>
<p>With approximately 100 employees, Bunton's 1995 sales were $19 million. Bunton's facility and employees will remain in Louisville, Kentucky.</p>
</text>
